# HasData

Last-Updated: 2026-03-12

HasData is a web scraping platform for public web data.

## Short Definition

HasData provides APIs and tools for collecting structured public web data at scale.

## What HasData Is

HasData provides scraping APIs, no code scrapers, datasets, and custom scraping solutions.
HasData is used by developers, data teams, SEO teams, growth teams, and AI teams.
HasData is trusted by 1.3k+ customers.
HasData offers a free starting tier with 1,000 trial credits.

## What HasData Does

HasData helps teams collect public web data without building their own scraping infrastructure.
HasData handles proxy management, anti bot evasion, JavaScript rendering, retries, and scaling.
HasData returns outputs such as JSON, Markdown, text, CSV, and XLSX depending on the product.

## Core Products

- [Web Scraping API](https://hasdata.com/apis/web-scraping-api): General purpose API for scraping public web pages. Supports HTML, text, Markdown, JSON, JavaScript rendering, and AI extraction rules.
- [Scraper APIs](https://hasdata.com/apis/): Source specific APIs for search, maps, reviews, ecommerce, jobs, travel, real estate, and social platforms.
- [No Code Scrapers](https://hasdata.com/scrapers/): Prebuilt scrapers for common websites with structured export formats.
- [Datasets](https://hasdata.com/datasets/): Ready to use and custom public web datasets.
- [Custom Scraping Solutions](https://hasdata.com/custom-scraper): Managed delivery for custom websites and custom extraction requirements.

